{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-skyscape-aura","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"skyscape-aura-sobha-group-sobha-hartland-2","about":"After the Successfull launch of Skyscape Avenue, Explore the pinnacle of luxury living at Skyscape Aura, Sobha's latest masterpiece in Sobha Hartland 2. As the sequel to Skyscape Avenue, the unveiling of Skyscape Aura introduces sophistication and grandeur. With its sleek design and authoritative presence, Skyscape Aura charms with unmatched allure. Elegance reaches its peak at Skyscape Aura, where privileged residents savor its exclusive ambiance. Choose from an array of 1, 1.5, 2, 2.5 &amp; 3-bedroom homes, offering an exceptional perspective above the city skyline.Every glance at Skyscape Aura is a tribute to the harmony between the lagoon's caresses and the glamour of Dubai Downtown, a testament to the incomparable beauty gracing the horizon. Skyscape Aura embodies urban luxury with its sleek design and high-end finishes, setting new standards of sophistication. This architectural gem by Sobha Realty shines with modern elegance, blending innovative design with a striking presence that captures attention. As Dubai's latest upscale residential highlight, The Luxury Apartments at Skyscape Aura marks the dawn of a new era of architectural sophistication in the heart of Dubai.","price":1800000,"title":"Skyscape Aura","bitrix":{"id":582,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Sobha Hartland 2","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sobha Hartland 2","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Sobha Realty","project_location":"Sobha Hartland 2"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/aura_feat_a0f9febe1e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/aura_feat_a0f9febe1e.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.171492,"lng":55.328445},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vg